<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 3.83 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 3.83 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 3.83 percent on Wednesday from 4.69 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in 13 reported transactions with a total value of 15 million dinars ($21 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
